<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila feed millers seek bids for 50,000T corn.</title>
<headline>Manila feed millers seek bids for 50,000T corn.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Association of Feed Millers Inc sought tenders on Thursday for 50,000 tonnes yellow corn, an official of the group told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;We are accepting tenders now,&quot; the officer said.</p>
<p>Other details of the tender were not immediately available.</p>
<p>--Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8936</p>
